Earlier this month I updated RevivedHack to version 1.4. This release
includes several bugfixes, a new message system, and a new user
interface for the Windows port.

RevivedHack is based on PC Hack 3.61, originally released in 1987. It
officially runs under Linux (Curses), Windows (DirectX), DOS
(Protected Mode), and PalmOS (3.0 or later). The DOS and Windows
console versions and other unofficial builds are available upon
request.

